# Files that stay out of the wp.org package.
#
# Matching is relative to the repository root. A pattern without a leading slash
# matches a file or directory name at any depth (`composer.json` also catches
# `plugin/composer.json`); a leading slash anchors the pattern to that exact
# root-relative path. `*` does not cross a directory separator.
#
# Local tooling and test scaffolding
node_modules
vendor
tests
test-scf
_research
.github
phpcs.xml.dist
phpunit.xml.dist
composer.json
composer.lock
package.json
package-lock.json
AGENTS.md
K7-RELEASE-BERICHT.md
# Documentation and packaging output that does not belong in the plugin dir.
# Anchored: the plugin ships its own LICENSE (a copy) and the repo-root one and
# README.md are not part of the package.
/README.md
/LICENSE
/sdc-page-builder.zip
# Contributor-facing notes next to the assets, not shipped code
/plugin/assets/README.md
